# Earnings reaction scanner — 2026-11-02

- Cron: `0 8 * * 1-5` America/New_York (weekdays, 08:00 ET)
- Fire time (ET): 2026-11-02 09:03:20 Mon
- Run type: `validation_run_offcycle` — the fire was NOT at the canonical 08:00 ET
  weekday slot.
  It fired at 09:03 ET on a weekday. The pre-market columns are
  live only if the fire was before the 09:30 ET US open; after that they are
  frozen at the open. The 08:00 ET fire is the one the skill is designed for.
  The scheduled weekday fire at 08:00 ET produces the live version.
- Source: TradingView public screener (`scanner.tradingview.com/<market>/scan`);
  Yahoo chart API as an independent cross-check on the reported movers.
- Method: 4 passes (US top-200 mcap, US prior-session movers, EU/UK movers,
  ASX movers). Volume floor 10,000 on every pass; `country` filter for
  primary listings; exchange drop-list applied.
- Status: `ok`

